# Optional. Absolute directory with wasm-validate, wasm-objdump, and wasm2wat
# from WABT 1.0.42. REA does not download WABT. Leave this unset to see the
# capability-unavailable card, which quotes REA's own remediation.
# Restart `npm run dev` after changing it.
# REA_WABT_BIN_DIRECTORY=/absolute/path/to/wabt/bin
